dt class=\"w-24 shrink-0 text-ink-muted font-medium\">Extras</dt><dd class=\"text-ink\">Intel AX210 WiFi 6E PCIe card, Eightwood Antenna kit, Thermalright Contact Frame for LGA1700</dd></div></dl></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-1\">Thermals</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted mb-4\">Ambient: <!-- -->23<!-- -->°C</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Part</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Idle</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Gaming</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Stress</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2.5 text-ink-muted uppercase text-xs font-semibold\">apu</td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums\"><span>23<!-- -->–<!-- -->25<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums\"><span>45<!-- -->–<!-- -->55<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums font-medium\"><span>60<!-- -->–<!-- -->66<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">64w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2.5 text-ink-muted uppercase text-xs font-semibold\">cpu</td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums\"><span>28<!-- -->–<!-- -->32<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums\"><span>55<!-- -->–<!-- -->65<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums font-medium\"><span>90<!-- -->–<!-- -->96<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">76w</td></tr></tbody></table></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Benchmarks</h2><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Cinebench R23</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">12,940</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">76<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">730</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">1,772</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">76<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Cinebench R24</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">739</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">69<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">705</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">105</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">69<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Unigine Heaven</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">720p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">3,435</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">136.4</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">64w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">1,591</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">63.1</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">64w</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Furmark</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">720p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">1,407</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">40.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">61w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">675</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">23.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">61w</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Builder notes</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\">A very simple iGPU case from Taobao that holds the motherboard with a Flex ATX PSU. The front and side support a single 3.5&quot; or 2.5&quot; SSD drive, with additional 2.5&quot; drives installable at the bottom or top. No official case fan support but 60mm x 25mm fans may be modded in. The ASRock B760M-HDV/m.2 is a budget board lacking WiFi, so an Intel AX210 WiFi 6E PCIe card was added. The board has weak VRMs and slow PCIe lanes, suitable for lower power CPUs but the stress test throttled the CPU to 65w due to the weaker components. The i5-14400 provides adequate performance for e-sports, arcade gaming and productivity. This is a fair APU build in a tiny travel package, good for work, multimedia and light gaming. Bigger than a NUC or ASRock Deskmini but offers decent performance in a compact form factor.</p></section></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Performance</h2><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">CPU — CB23 Multi</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">12,940</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\" style=\"width:37%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->63<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">170.3</span> pts/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-sff-red\">-1<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">GPU — Heaven 1080p</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">63.1<!-- --> <span class=\"text-base font-normal text-ink-muted\">fps</span></p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\" style=\"width:23%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->77<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">0.99</span> fps/w</span></div></div></section></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-surface mt-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-8\"><div><p class=\"font-semibold text-ink mb-1\">ComponentWatch</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted max-w-xs\">Community-verified benchmarks and real-world data for small-form-factor PC builders.</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-12 text-sm\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Explore</p><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/builds\">Builds</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/cases\">Cases</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/compare\">Compare</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/ai-builds\">AI Builds</a></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Community</p><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/submit\">Submit a build</a><a href=\"https://reddit.com/r/sffpc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\">r/sffpc</a></div></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-line\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-faint\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> ComponentWatch. Prices updated every 30 minutes via affiliate links.</p></div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-928fbb6057b777a4.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n3:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[8924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[4431,[